## TC/SC RULES — MEMORIZE

```
Single loop       → O(n)
Nested loop       → O(n²)
Divide in half    → O(log n)
Loop + divide     → O(n log n)
```

- Group Anagrams: O(n · m log m), SC = O(n·m)
- Top K Frequent: O(n log k), SC = O(n)
- Product of Array Except Self: O(n) time, O(1) space
- Longest Substring LC #3: O(n) time, O(n) space
- Sliding Window Max LC #239: O(n) time, O(k) space

